    "body": "The comment was added by me in https://chromium.googlesource.com/chromium/src/+/f252a000237623fb2acb3aa2c0eb9d638a619680 and the code itself traces back into WebKit through a bunch of changes, but probably originally by @eric-carlson, and I'd bet Safari also still updates text track rendering when the mode changes.\r\n\r\n@cpearce @jyavenard do you know who knows this code in Gecko?\r\n\r\nAt the end of the day, I suspect all that needs to happen here is a small spec change. I'm gonna call it good first bug and hope :)",
